<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>PAT-HOT · T激光</title><link>https://sun-zihang.github.io/pat-hot/#/all</link><description>激光</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:36 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>‘Cooked’ fiber doubles range of ultralow-noise supercontinuum lasers</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55408688/cooked-fiber-doubles-range-of-ultralow-noise-supercontinuum-lasers</link><description>After heating an optical fiber for nearly an hour, researchers completely changed its dispersion within a small section and ended up with a supercontinuum that covers a wide range of wavelengths—0.86 to 2.90 µm—and it’s also remarkably stable and reliable.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">8c5f75047f13</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:36 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Ultraviolet laser pulses engineer diamond defects selectively, leaving quantum qubits intact</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ultraviolet-laser-pulses-diamond-defects.html</link><description>When we think about a diamond, we often think about a material whose value comes from its perfection. In my research, however, I am interested in something almost opposite: the tiny imperfections inside diamonds. These atomic-scale defects can give diamonds new optical and electronic properties, and some of them can serve as quantum systems. The challenge is learning how to control these defects without disturbing the others.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e1f4243c1ce7</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:36 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Ultrashort laser pulses let new microscope map electron interactions across thin materials</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ultrashort-laser-pulses-microscope-electron.html</link><description>A new type of advanced microscope (wide-field coherent multidimensional microscopy) has been developed. It uses a carefully designed sequence of ultrashort light pulses to study the behavior of high-tech materials, with potential practical applications in the study of innovative materials such as those used to build solar panels. This is the result of work by a research group of physicists from the Faculty of Sciences, Mathematics, Physics, and Natural Sciences at Università Cattolica's Brescia </description><guid isPermaLink="false">1c8b047260ce</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:36 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Don't miss Laser Focus World’s PhotonicsNXT 2026 virtual event!</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/resources/media-gallery/55411422/dont-miss-laser-focus-worlds-photonicsnxt-2026-virtual-event</link><description>PhotonicsNXT brings the optics, photonics, and quantum community together for a 2-day series of educational presentations covering a range of advances, innovations, and applications.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">7ca7da7e934c</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:36 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>频准激光上半年营收2.56亿元增42.13% 净利润增24.58%</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/123/a1316461.html</link><description>C114讯 8月27日消息（颜翊）昨日，本月18日刚刚上市的量子科技公司频准激光披露首份半年度业绩报告，2026年上半年，公司实现营业收入2.56亿元，同比增长42.13%；实现归母净利润8833.57万元，同比增长24.58%。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">f1f6e3bfdfe0</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:36 GMT</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_通信财经</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>零跑B10 540激光雷达版卖到11.98万,家用纯电SUV真能做到“无短板”吗?</title><link>https://weixin.sogou.com/link?url=dn9a_-gY295K0Rci_xozVXfdMkSQTLW6cwJThYulHEtVjXrGTiVgS7_-9fN-vB2pIXth7G-GrFJV_Kwi0GO5j1qXa8Fplpd9fMdZzIDkJmsS_SC_zzr8ivdg645CjieLksEIncH5Pn3rSzAKvqijxyglmdvLa_0e1E_tymB8oJLMYgVKjSQZJkeDNTbeWG9AlTSg5fVzBFEXL3S3TvounXUjRZP2yxh5ea4fJdsyaPyoQpV2eynt71tk70LScnf_5z2n_S9exupQL0Hr9Gyd3Q..&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;query=%E6%BF%80%E5%85%89%E9%9B%B7